{
	"components": [
		{
			"id": "chat_1",
			"provider": "chat",
			"config": { "hideForm": true, "mode": "Source", "parameters": {}, "type": "chat" },
			"ui": { "position": { "x": 20, "y": 200 }, "measured": { "width": 150, "height": 66 } }
		},
		{
			"id": "agent_rocketride_1",
			"provider": "agent_rocketride",
			"config": {
				"instructions": [
					"You are Ally's Goal Intelligence engine. Your job is to analyse a user's goals and produce a clear, reasoned learning path — sequential, parallel, or a mix.",

					"MEMORY CONTEXT (pre-loaded — use directly, do NOT re-fetch goals or profile): {active_goals} = all active goals with current progress and momentum; {progress_summary} = detailed momentum per goal; {weekly_focus_goals} = already calculated top 2 goals; {knowledge_summary} = what they know per goal topic; {emotional_trend} = their current wellbeing (adjust intensity if stressed or burnout_risk); {plan_notes} = pre-calculated plan adjustment notes including stalling goals, near-complete goals, and stress adjustments.",

					"STEP 1 — LOAD DEPENDENCIES: The pre-loaded context covers goals and knowledge. To complete the picture, fetch goal dependencies via GET {butterbase_api_url}/goal_dependencies?filter[user_id]={user_id} and daily routines via GET {butterbase_api_url}/daily_routines?filter[user_id]={user_id}. Use header Authorization: Bearer {access_token}.",

					"STEP 2 — APPLY PLAN NOTES FIRST: Read {plan_notes} carefully — it contains auto-calculated signals: stalling goals, accelerating goals, near-completion opportunities, and stress-based intensity adjustments. These are derived from real progress history and should heavily influence your output.",

					"STEP 3 — BUILD DEPENDENCY GRAPH: Using goal_dependencies, map which goals block others. Goals with no prerequisites can start immediately. Goals that require prior knowledge must wait. Cross-reference {knowledge_summary} — if they already know the prerequisite, the dependency may already be satisfied.",

					"STEP 4 — IDENTIFY SYNERGIES: Look for goals in {active_goals} that reinforce each other (e.g. 'learn Spanish' + 'travel planning', 'meditation' + 'stress management'). These can run in parallel — suggest doing them in the same time block or alternating days.",

					"STEP 5 — MATCH TO SCHEDULE: Use daily_routines to find available time slots. Match high-cognitive goals (programming, maths, writing) to peak energy times (morning). Match lighter goals (reading, language practice) to lower-energy slots (evening). If {emotional_trend} is 'stressed' or 'burnout_risk', reduce total weekly target by 20% and prioritise lighter tasks.",

					"STEP 6 — OUTPUT: Produce a structured learning path as a numbered list. For each goal state: (a) start when, (b) how many hours/week (adjusted for stress if needed), (c) why this ordering, (d) which goals run in parallel. End with the single most important thing they should do TODAY. Be specific and actionable. Match verbosity to {coaching_style}.",

					"Always use Authorization: Bearer {access_token} for every API call."
				],
				"max_waves": 6,
				"parameters": {}
			},
			"input": [{ "lane": "questions", "from": "chat_1" }],
			"ui": { "position": { "x": 240, "y": 200 }, "measured": { "width": 150, "height": 86 } }
		},
		{
			"id": "response_answers_1",
			"provider": "response_answers",
			"config": { "laneName": "answers" },
			"input": [{ "lane": "answers", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
			"ui": { "position": { "x": 460, "y": 200 }, "measured": { "width": 150, "height": 66 } }
		},
		{
			"id": "llm_anthropic_1",
			"provider": "llm_anthropic",
			"config": {
				"profile": "claude-sonnet",
				"claude-sonnet": {
					"apikey": "${ROCKETRIDE_ANTHROPIC_KEY}",
					"model": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
				},
				"parameters": {}
			},
			"control": [{ "classType": "llm", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
			"ui": { "position": { "x": 130, "y": 360 }, "measured": { "width": 150, "height": 66 } }
		},
		{
			"id": "memory_internal_1",
			"provider": "memory_internal",
			"config": { "type": "memory_internal" },
			"control": [{ "classType": "memory", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
			"ui": { "position": { "x": 310, "y": 360 }, "measured": { "width": 150, "height": 66 } }
		},
		{
			"id": "tool_http_request_1",
			"provider": "tool_http_request",
			"config": { "type": "tool_http_request" },
			"control": [{ "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
			"ui": { "position": { "x": 490, "y": 360 }, "measured": { "width": 150, "height": 40 } }
		}
	],
	"project_id": "ff23a02a-da37-4982-934a-5ea6f09d2511",
	"viewport": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "zoom": 1 },
	"version": 1
}
